{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51615","headline":"独坐（句） · 潘佑","name":"独坐（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凝神入混茫，万象成空虚（一作「万有成虚空」。\n）（《诗话总龟後集》四三《释氏门》引《法藏碎金》。\n又《全五代诗》三一引）（〖1〗《法藏碎金录》卷七收二句，作「凝神入混沌，万法成虚空」。\n同书卷六录前一句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"潘佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51615.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51615","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}